+# TASK-260830-236x9n recovery revision 4 logbook
+
+- Finding: worktree Change Request candidates are intentionally uncommitted relative to `HEAD`; therefore `go generate ... && git diff --exit-code -- generated.go` rejects every legitimate candidate that changes the generated file, even when regeneration is byte-idempotent.
+- Decision: keep the gate strict by adding `cataloggen -check`, which compares regenerated bytes to the candidate output without mutation. Do not weaken the gate to generation-only success.
+- Negative evidence: the production CLI refused an intentionally stale output with exit 1 and left its bytes unchanged.
+- Anomaly: `task-board validate` exited 0 while reporting 263 unrelated legacy `MISSING_ACTIVITY` warnings.
+- Anomaly: macOS Finder recreated root `.DS_Store` immediately after recoverable removal. Root `.gitignore` now excludes it from Change Request construction deterministically.
